### get ratings
GET http://localhost:3000/ratings HTTP/1.1

### get one rating
GET http://localhost:3000/ratings/rat_ HTTP/1.1

### get one rating
# ! uknown rating
GET http://localhost:3000/ratings/rat_1nconnue HTTP/1.1

### delete rating
DELETE http://localhost:3000/ratings/rat_ HTTP/1.1

### delete place (will delete linked ratings)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/places/pla_ HTTP/1.1
